  "description": "<html>\n        <head>\n        \n        </head>\n        <body >\n        <div style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#111827; max-width:980px; margin:0 auto;\"><section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:18px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\"><div style=\"font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">📚 Re:Zero − Starting Life in Another World Light Novel English Version Vol. 1–26 New Sealed</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Enter the emotional fantasy world of <strong>Re:Zero − Starting Life in Another World</strong>, a popular light novel series by <strong>Tappei Nagatsuki</strong> featuring isekai adventure, fantasy drama, supernatural mystery, and powerful character growth.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">✨ This listing is for <strong>Re:Zero − Starting Life in Another World Light Novel English Version</strong>, covering <strong>Volumes 1–26</strong>. Condition: <strong>Brand New &amp; Sealed</strong>. Set Type: <strong>FULL SET</strong>. Finish: <strong>With Jacket Matte Laminate</strong>. 🚚 Shipping available as stated in the listing.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #fecaca; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#fff1f2;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">📌 Important Edition Notice</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Please read carefully before purchasing. This is a <strong>local / underground reading edition</strong>, printed by <strong>Mangahouz</strong>. It is <strong>NOT an official publisher edition</strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">This book set is not from Viz Media, Square Enix, Kodansha, Yen Press, Tokyopop, Vertical, or similar official producers. It is <strong>not recommended / not suitable for collectors</strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">This edition is suitable for <strong>first-time light novel readers, casual readers, anime fans, fantasy fans, and pleasure reading</strong>. The content follows the original story, but this is a local reading print by Mangahouz. Official editions usually cost more.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">Minor print, trim, colour, paper, cover, jacket, binding, and finishing variations may occur due to local batch production.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 10px;\">✅ Quick Highlights</div>\n<div style=\"display:block;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-block; border:1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; margin:0 6px 8px 0; background:#f9fafb;\">📚 FULL SET Vol. 1–26</span>\n<span style=\"display:inline-block; border:1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; margin:0 6px 8px 0; background:#f9fafb;\">🇬🇧 English Version</span>\n<span style=\"display:inline-block; border:1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; margin:0 6px 8px 0; background:#f9fafb;\">🆕 Brand New &amp; Sealed</span>\n<span style=\"display:inline-block; border:1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; margin:0 6px 8px 0; background:#f9fafb;\">📘 Jacket Matte Laminate</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">📖 Story Overview</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\"><strong>Re:Zero − Starting Life in Another World</strong> follows Subaru Natsuki, a modern-day teenager who is suddenly transported into a mysterious fantasy world filled with magic, danger, political tension, and hidden secrets.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Subaru soon discovers a strange ability called “Return by Death,” which causes time to repeat after certain fatal events while leaving him with the memories of what happened before. As he forms bonds with Emilia, Rem, Beatrice, and many others, he must face difficult choices and grow through each challenge.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">Across Volumes 1–26, the series delivers fantasy adventure, emotional drama, supernatural mystery, political conflict, and strong character development for readers who enjoy deep isekai light novels.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">📌 Key Details</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:20px;\">\n<li><strong>Title / Series:</strong> Re:Zero − Starting Life in Another World</li>\n<li><strong>Volumes:</strong> 1–26</li>\n<li><strong>Set Type:</strong> FULL SET</li>\n<li><strong>Language:</strong> English Version</li>\n<li><strong>Author:</strong> Tappei Nagatsuki</li>\n<li><strong>Genre:</strong> Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Isekai, Drama, Supernatural</li>\n<li><strong>Format:</strong> Paperback light novel text-based reading edition</li>\n<li><strong>Condition:</strong> Brand New &amp; Sealed</li>\n<li><strong>Finish:</strong> With jacket matte laminate</li>\n<li><strong>Publisher / Printing:</strong> Local / underground printing by Mangahouz</li>\n<li><strong>Intended Use:</strong> Reading copy, not suitable for collectors</li>\n<li><strong>Shipping:</strong> Shipping available as stated in the listing</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">✨ Edition &amp; Quality Notes</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">This is a budget-friendly local reading edition made for readers who want to enjoy the story in English. It is not an official publisher edition and is best purchased as a casual reading copy.</p>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 8px; padding-left:20px;\">\n<li>Paperback light novel format 